Offer the spreadsheet picker when the user asks to browse, choose, or upload a template. For ordinary creation, offer it only for a matching enabled personal, shared, or team `artifact-template-` skill; `openai-templates:` defaults alone do not qualify. Skip it for a specific already-selected template, a controlling reference, or a requested custom aesthetic.

Use `artifactKind: "google-sheets"` only when the user limits results to Google Sheets; otherwise use `"spreadsheet"`. For `.xlsx`-only requests, call `list_artifact_templates({artifactKind: "spreadsheet", request})` and pass only its returned templates without `includeAllTemplates`. For an otherwise explicit all/every/full-catalog request, call `choose_artifact_template({artifactKind, templates: [], includeAllTemplates: true})`; the exact Google kind keeps Google-only results isolated. For other task-specific requests, call `list_artifact_templates({artifactKind, request})` with the user's substantive request, then compare titles and descriptions semantically. Show only a direct subject or name match; otherwise offer at most three genuinely same-domain options. Never add unrelated templates based on shared format or generic words. Pass catalog choices as `{skillName}` and ordinary-creation personal/custom choices as `{skillName, skillPath}`.

Use each tool directly or search once for its exact name; call the picker at most once. Preserve trusted skill names and paths; never scan the filesystem or use user-supplied skill paths. On `selected`, follow the returned `skillPath` or `skillName`. On `uploaded`, use `path` as the controlling reference. Save only when `saveForFutureUse` is `true`: invoke Template Creator with the exact returned `displayName`, create its required preview, save the personal template, and finish the original artifact. When `false`, use the reference for this task only. Never replace the picker with a prose list. If it is unavailable, declined, cancelled, unsupported, or errors, continue creation in the same turn; for browse-only requests, report that no template was selected and create nothing.

